        "cooked": "<p><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Lucida, Lucida Grande, Trebuchet MS, Tahoma, Verdana, sans-serif\"><font>I just signed up to volunteer at PAX Prime with GTG, and assuming that they accept me I am looking for a roommate to help offset to cost of a hotel.</font></font></font></p><p><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Lucida, Lucida Grande, Trebuchet MS, Tahoma, Verdana, sans-serif\"><font>If anyone would be interested shoot me a message here (</font></font></font><a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/user/Lontra\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><font color=\"#008eb1\"><font face=\"Lucida, Lucida Grande, Trebuchet MS, Tahoma, Verdana, sans-serif\"><font>or on BGG</font></font></font></a><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Lucida, Lucida Grande, Trebuchet MS, Tahoma, Verdana, sans-serif\"><font>) or reply to this thread and we can see if we can work something out.</font></font></font></p><p><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Lucida, Lucida Grande, Trebuchet MS, Tahoma, Verdana, sans-serif\"><font>-Greg</font></font></font></p>",
